        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 9:31AM EDT until September 26 at 10:00PM EDT by NWS Baltimore MD/Washington DC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...For the Small Craft Advisory, north winds 20 to 25 kt
with gusts up to 35 kt. For the Gale Warning, north winds 20
to 30 kt with gusts up to 35 kt and waves 2 to 4 ft expected.

* WHERE...Choptank River to Cambridge MD and the Little Choptank
River.

* WHEN...For the Small Craft Advisory, until 6 PM EDT this
evening. For the Gale Warning, from 6 PM this evening to 10 PM
EDT Saturday.

* IMPACTS...Strong winds will cause hazardous waves which could
capsize or damage vessels.
</description>
        <instruction>Mariners should alter plans to avoid these hazardous conditions.
Remain in port, seek safe harbor, alter course, and/or secure the
vessel for hazardous conditions.</instruction>
